demonstrate those things?

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:10.180
But I always find the intellectual
vitality almost the hardest because you

00:09:10.180 --> 00:09:11.750
can find it anywhere.

00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:16.030
And I think one of the misses we're
just looking at GPA and test scores.

00:09:16.030 --> 00:09:21.124
In reality, we're looking for evidence
that you've had interesting ideas,

00:09:21.124 --> 00:09:24.469
fundamentally what leaders
do if we think about that

00:09:24.469 --> 00:09:29.410
leaders are influencing others to
collaborate towards a common goal.

00:09:29.410 --> 00:09:32.950
And part of that maybe having a good
idea about how to solve a problem so

00:09:32.950 --> 00:09:36.508
