to day work that you're having now.

00:09:36.508 --> 00:09:40.385
Where you thought of something someone
else hadn't or someone shared an idea and

00:09:40.385 --> 00:09:44.050
you jumped on it to help that team move
in just a little different direction.

00:09:44.050 --> 00:09:46.590
I mean, I would say intellectual vitality.

00:09:46.590 --> 00:09:50.085
We'll get to the gold star on our team
this week because this is a great

00:09:50.085 --> 00:09:51.280
example of us.

00:09:51.280 --> 00:09:54.097
Just talking as an institution
as a team and saying, hey,

00:09:54.097 --> 00:09:55.600
we want to be more transparent.

00:09:55.600 --> 00:09:57.063
How can we really be helpful and

00:09:57.063 --> 00:09:59.600
beginning to see a new way
that we might do something?

00:09:59.600 --> 00:10:02.950
So we'd love to see in your application,
it might come from your references,

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:04.870
it might come in your short answers.

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:08.110
It might come from the kinds of things
you studied on your transcript.

00:10:08.110 --> 00:10:12.207
Those are all places where you can
demonstrate that you're curious and

00:10:12.207 --> 00:10:15.910
engaged and
thinking about new ways to do things.

00:10:15.910 --> 00:10:19.927
&gt;&gt; Yeah, and as we're talking about things
popping up across kind of the whole

00:10:19.927 --> 00:10:23.660
application, just the concept
of the holistic review process.

00:10:23.660 --> 00:10:25.980
I've talked a lot about it this week.

00:10:25.980 --> 00:10:30.610
I think people have heard my explanation
for it, but it would be really nice to

00:10:30.610 --> 00:10:34.920
hear how you articulate and
understand the holistic review process.

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:37.245
I know I've talked about
the application and

00:10:37.245 --> 00:10:41.284
each section is like a part of the picture
and each helps us understand, like,

00:10:41.284 --> 00:10:43.812
who you might be in our classroom and
community?

00:10:43.812 --> 00:10:47.256
And things are just like we're
making assessments on the whole and

00:10:47.256 --> 00:10:48.620
not just on any one piece.

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:53.195
How would you explain it to someone if
they asked you what is the holistic review

00:10:53.195 --> 00:10:53.830
process?

00:10:55.770 --> 00:10:58.317
&gt;&gt; I think you just heat it up well,
well and that

00:10:58.317 --> 00:11:03.280
you can't make a decision on any applicant
from just a part of the application.

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:06.800
But I also it's easy to be up here and
I know many schools, a holistic and skull.

00:11:06.800 --> 00:11:07.560
What does that mean?

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:09.580
You know, tell me more about that.

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:13.846
So I think if we go back to what I just
said about the goals that we're looking

00:11:13.846 --> 00:11:18.184
for someone who's engaged in a class,
who's done positive things in their

00:11:18.184 --> 00:11:22.930
community and also will help to make
a positive community wherever they are.

00:11:22.930 --> 00:11:25.439
Like those should be your guiding north,
but

00:11:25.439 --> 00:11:29.465
they will we have to look across your
your essays which are going to really

00:11:29.465 --> 00:11:33.910
it'll shed light on who you are and the
choices you made and what you care about.

00:11:33.910 --> 00:11:37.879
As well as our short answers,
which tells us like what you have done and

00:11:37.879 --> 00:11:41.982
then looking at some of the other,
as I said for intellectual Vitality,

00:11:41.982 --> 00:11:44.400
we can find it in different places.

00:11:44.400 --> 00:11:50.065
We are looking like a heat-seeking missile
