00:11:50.065 --> 00:11:56.620
there's no, like I was laughing, Will,
as I was thinking about our talk today.

00:11:56.620 --> 00:11:59.149
If someone asked me like,
how do you read an application,

00:11:59.149 --> 00:12:02.260
I feel like every time I read
an application, it's different.

00:12:02.260 --> 00:12:06.096
