comes up and I'll maybe it is about

00:12:09.940 --> 00:12:12.840
intellectual vitality, and
I'll jump to your transcript over.

00:12:12.840 --> 00:12:15.520
So I'd be happy to share a little
bit more about how that works.

00:12:15.520 --> 00:12:18.812
But the point is, it's holistic, you need
all of these parts in order to come up

00:12:18.812 --> 00:12:21.440
with a good assessment
at the end of the day.

00:12:21.440 --> 00:12:24.318
&gt;&gt; There have been a lot
of questions about process,

00:12:24.318 --> 00:12:28.370
[LAUGH] so I wanted to direct make sure
that we spent some time today too.

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:30.809
So this is kind of like the perfect segue.

00:12:30.809 --> 00:12:32.712
&gt;&gt; Awesome.
&gt;&gt; People have been curious

00:12:32.712 --> 00:12:36.660
about the process, so
any light that you could shed into it?

00:12:36.660 --> 00:12:41.590
And then, understanding like, okay, to
