00:12:41.590 --> 00:12:46.399
Valuable versus like, how can we focus our
energies such that we can show up our best

00:12:46.399 --> 00:12:48.060
selves in the application?

00:12:50.480 --> 00:12:54.815
&gt;&gt; So that's a great question and maybe I
can give some examples even of how I read

00:12:54.815 --> 00:12:57.530
applications to bring it more to life.

00:12:57.530 --> 00:13:01.341
But at the top level,
what we're with the admissions team,

00:13:01.341 --> 00:13:06.273
all the admissions officers and I are
trying to do that we're trying to give you

00:13:06.273 --> 00:13:09.430
real estate so
that you can tell your whole story.

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:13.298
